# 058 · Helm charts and an npm package

**Status:** `PROPOSED` · **Version:** [later](../roadmap.md#later)

## What

Helm charts for clusters that run through GitOps, and a `create-thermite` package for Node users.

## Why

Some teams deploy only through charts, and some start every tool from npm.

## Done when

- [ ] The charts install control and a rig on a local cluster.
- [ ] `npm create thermite` starts a project.

## Decisions

None yet.

## Open questions

None.

